# Autonomy Evidence Gate

Use one gate per capability and consequence class. Expansion in one area does
not imply expansion everywhere.

## Artifact metadata

| Field | Value |
| --- | --- |
| Artifact ID | Assign `AEG-<system>-<nnn>` |
| Version | 0.1-template |
| Owner | Unassigned |
| Case/capability | Unassigned |
| Artifact state | BLANK |
| Test execution state | PLANNED/UNRUN |
| Evidence references | None; add accepted asset, claim, experiment, and decision IDs |
| Decision date | NOT_YET_DECIDED |
| Supersedes / superseded by | None |
| Reconsideration trigger | New capability, consequence, population, provider, policy, failure, or evidence |

## Proposed change

- Current permitted action:
- Proposed additional autonomy:
- Reader/customer/business benefit:
- New consequence or failure surface:
- Reversibility:

## Entry evidence

| Evidence class | Required result | Observed result | Limit of proof | Status |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| Meaning and authority review | | | | |
| Tool contract and policy tests | | | | |
| Context/memory fitness | | | | |
| Duplicate, retry, and loop tests | | | | |
| Adversarial and misuse tests | | | | |
| Outcome evaluation | | | | |
| Human-review capacity | | | | |
| Incident tabletop | | | | |

## Exposure plan

- Eligible tenants, subjects, or cases:
- Initial traffic/action percentage:
- Action budget:
- Monitoring window:
- Automatic stop conditions:
- Human rollback authority:
- Downstream correction plan:

## Decision

- Approve / restrict / reject:
- Evidence supporting decision:
- Uncertainty retained:
- Date and accountable approver:
- Expansion criteria:
- Mandatory reconsideration date or trigger:

## Review record

- Editorial/technical reviewers:
- Review date:
- Artifact-state decision:
- Restrictions or required follow-up:
